#. (+%3%)", "%1%(+%2%) soldiers (+%3%)", 0),
#. TRANSLATORS: %1% is the number of Atlantean soldiers the plural refers to.
#. %2% are currently open soldier slots in the building.
#. UNUSED_soldier_3 = npgettext("atlanteans_soldier", "%1%(+%2%) soldier",
