#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for a Barbarian resource indicator: Gold, part 1
#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Empire resource indicator: Gold, part 1
#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for a Frisian resource indicator: Gold, part 1
