msgstr "这里的铁很多。"

#. TRANSLATORS: Helptext for an Atlantean resource indicator: Stones, part 2
#: ../../../../data/tribes/initialization/atlanteans/units.lua:1320
msgid "There are many precious stones here."
msgstr "这里的宝石很多。"

